                  {\|A\|_{-1}} \longrightarrow \neg(\neg{A})
          %p
            and this is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-epimorphism"} 1-epimorphism
            precisely if the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/law+of+excluded+middle"} law of excluded middle
            holds.
